    <string name="direct_zlink">Use ZLink directly (experimental)</string>
    <string name="direct_zlink_help">Off uses the proven Joying interface. On reads ZLink directly for richer navigation, including roundabout angles when available. Changes apply immediately while running. If updates stop, switch this off and save diagnostics; the existing log is kept. Stop the separate Direct Probe before enabling this.</string>
